# Captured 2026-09-10 on this box: sway 1.11 headless with one
# HEADLESS-1 at 1280x720, Xwayland 24.1.10, through the recording
# forwarder scratchpad/b7/rec.py. RANDR major 139, root 0x234,
# crtc 0x20, output 0x21.
# GetCrtcGamma(0x20) reply: 256 ramp entries, 1568 bytes. The proxy
# never touches gamma -- `--gamma` through it is Xwayland's, and
# `wxrandr --gamma` the compositor's.

